From 6e0d15a0e76c9d540e9f3f6cf8e9262bd742e9d2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 05:46:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] test: put each optional-extra guard above the module's first
 aiohttp/acp import

In 35 files the guard sat below a 'from aiohttp import web' (or an acp_adapter import), because
the collect log only showed the line that failed after another test's MagicMock stub let the first
import through. Collected alone in a venv without aiohttp, those files still errored (e.g.
pytest --collect-only tests/tui_gateway, tests/gateway/test_managed_entry.py). Each of the 139
touched test files now collects alone in the hub production venv (rc 0 or 5).
---
